      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹27.24 (up from ₹24.95 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹14.8b (down 2.3% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹1.17b (up 9.2% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.9% (up from 7.1% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 7% per year but the company’s share price has remained flat, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
